# Delicious — Savor Flavor Restaurant Landing Page

A modern, responsive **restaurant landing page** built with **HTML5, Tailwind CSS, and custom CSS animations**.

The project focuses on practicing modern frontend development through the implementation of a visually rich restaurant interface, including responsive layouts, typography, navigation, food product cards, and CSS-based interactions.

---

# Overview

Delicious is a restaurant-focused landing page designed to present a modern dining brand and showcase its signature recipes.

The interface includes:

- Navigation header
- Hero section
- Chef introduction
- Restaurant statistics
- Brand highlight banner
- Recipe showcase
- Interactive hover effects

The project was created as a practical frontend exercise to strengthen my ability to transform a visual concept into a responsive and structured web interface.

---

# Why I Built This

This project was built as part of my **Frontend Development learning journey**.

The main goal was to practice building a visually focused interface while improving my understanding of how layout, typography, imagery, and interactions work together.

Through this project, I practiced:

- Structuring a complete landing page
- Creating responsive layouts
- Using Tailwind CSS utility classes
- Combining Tailwind with custom CSS
- Working with different typography styles
- Creating image-based product sections
- Implementing CSS hover animations
- Building visually consistent UI sections

The project helped me move beyond simply writing HTML and CSS toward understanding how to **analyze a design and turn it into a functional interface**.

